{"overview":"یک نوجوان نابغه در مکانی عجیب از خواب بیدار می‌شود؛ جایی که پر است از کودکانی با توانایی‌های خارق‌العاده، درست مثل خودش—و همه به شیوه‌ای مرموز به آنجا منتقل شده‌اند. در این فضای اسرارآمیز، رازهایی در کمین‌اند که می‌توانند مسیر زندگی‌شان را دگرگون کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When 14 year old genius Luke Ellis is kidnapped, he awakens at The Institute, a facility full of children who all got there the same way he did, and who are all possessed of unusual abilities. In a nearby town, haunted former police officer Tim Jamieson has come looking to start a new life, but the peace and quiet won’t last, as his story and Luke’s are destined to collide.","tagline_en":"","runtime":58,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2025,"poster":"/xLprBjhZwtgUcEkl49VTOtsQNEd.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/v60nRL49q8JvqRIM4ykOuZS6NZu.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["Benjamin Cavell"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"بن بارنز","role":"Tim Jamieson","photo":"/k0tAM9XK0s4n0VQq1jX5cGf9uAa.jpg","en":"Ben Barnes"},{"name":"Joe Freeman","role":"Luke Ellis","photo":"/z0AzrUstVOkw2wDanWtTFAvzvY2.jpg"},{"name":"Simone Miller","role":"Kalisha","photo":"/IK00CWfqxWGPo71Nsy3aBcVs0Z.jpg"},{"name":"Fionn Laird","role":"Nick Wilholm","photo":"/rkXhob9jRnLsFJk04qSKi4og2rN.jpg"},{"name":"هانا گالوی","role":"Wendy Gullickson","photo":"/5vEWCUQAs7KHfNcarcUN810jwdE.jpg","en":"Hannah Galway"},{"name":"Robert Joy","role":"Hendricks","photo":"/kPY9ggs4qCi3oeEvkYP17Yvfm5r.jpg"},{"name":"مری-لوئیز پارکر","role":"Ms. Sigsby","photo":"/1ohhrIZ4OMlLx9DvHjPhQJAIP0F.jpg","en":"Mary-Louise Parker"}],"trailer":"1BcvAdfyL5Y","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/253372-the-institute/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"fuboTV","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/3wF8xISfVlcrc8X3jaa3uMUFGAr.png"},{"n":"MGM+ Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/g